{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-switching-fundamentals","title":"路由交换基础技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols/routing-switching-fundamentals","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"路由交换基础技术\">路由交换基础技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>路由和交换是构建所有企业网络的两大基石技术——交换机负责局域网内部的高速帧转发，路由器负责不同网络之间的IP分组选路。掌握VLAN、STP、静态路由、OSPF和ACL这五项核心技术，便能独立完成中小型企业网络的规划配置与故障排查。</p>\n<h3 id=\"vlan与trunk技术\">VLAN与Trunk技术</h3><p>VLAN（虚拟局域网）通过逻辑划分将一台物理交换机分割为多个独立的广播域，实现部门隔离和广播风暴抑制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    SW[&quot;核心交换机&quot;]&#10;    SW --&gt;|&quot;Trunk 802.1Q&quot;| SW1[&quot;接入交换机1&quot;]&#10;    SW --&gt;|&quot;Trunk 802.1Q&quot;| SW2[&quot;接入交换机2&quot;]&#10;    SW1 --&gt;|&quot;VLAN 10&quot;| PC1[&quot;研发部PC&quot;]&#10;    SW1 --&gt;|&quot;VLAN 20&quot;| PC2[&quot;财务部PC&quot;]&#10;    SW2 --&gt;|&quot;VLAN 10&quot;| PC3[&quot;研发部PC&quot;]&#10;    SW2 --&gt;|&quot;VLAN 20&quot;| PC4[&quot;财务部PC&quot;]\">graph TD\n    SW[\"核心交换机\"]\n    SW --&gt;|\"Trunk 802.1Q\"| SW1[\"接入交换机1\"]\n    SW --&gt;|\"Trunk 802.1Q\"| SW2[\"接入交换机2\"]\n    SW1 --&gt;|\"VLAN 10\"| PC1[\"研发部PC\"]\n    SW1 --&gt;|\"VLAN 20\"| PC2[\"财务部PC\"]\n    SW2 --&gt;|\"VLAN 10\"| PC3[\"研发部PC\"]\n    SW2 --&gt;|\"VLAN 20\"| PC4[\"财务部PC\"]</pre><p><strong>VLAN工作原理</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Access端口：连接终端设备，收到无标签帧时打上PVID标签，发出时剥离标签</li>\n<li>Trunk端口：连接交换机之间，承载多VLAN流量，使用802.1Q协议在帧中插入4字节标签字段（TPID + Priority + CFI + VLAN ID）</li>\n<li>VLAN ID范围：0-4095，其中1为默认VLAN，2-1001为标准范围，1006-4094为扩展范围</li>\n</ul>\n<p>802.1Q标签结构中VLAN ID字段为12位，因此理论最大VLAN数量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{max} = 2^{12} = 4096</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际可用范围去除保留值后约为4094个。</p>\n<h3 id=\"stp生成树协议\">STP生成树协议</h3><p>当交换网络存在冗余链路时，会形成二层环路导致广播风暴。STP（Spanning Tree Protocol, IEEE 802.1D）通过选举和阻塞机制消除环路：</p>\n<p><strong>STP选举过程</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>选举根桥（Root Bridge）：Bridge ID最小的交换机（优先级 + MAC地址）</li>\n<li>选举根端口（Root Port）：非根桥上到根桥路径开销最小的端口</li>\n<li>选举指定端口（Designated Port）：每个网段上到根桥开销最小的端口</li>\n<li>阻塞非指定端口（Blocked Port）：其余端口进入阻塞状态</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>路径开销计算</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>链路速率</th>\n<th>IEEE开销值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10 Mbps</td>\n<td>100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 Mbps</td>\n<td>19</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 Gbps</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 Gbps</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RSTP（802.1w）将收敛时间从30-50秒缩短到1-2秒，MSTP（802.1s）支持按VLAN组实例化生成树，实现负载均衡。</p>\n<h3 id=\"静态路由与默认路由\">静态路由与默认路由</h3><p>静态路由由管理员手动配置，适用于拓扑简单或需要精确控制流量路径的场景。</p>\n<p>路由表匹配遵循<strong>最长前缀匹配</strong>原则。对于目标地址 <code>192.168.10.5</code>，路由表中存在：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>192.168.10.0/24</code> → 下一跳A</li>\n<li><code>192.168.10.0/28</code> → 下一跳B</li>\n</ul>\n<p>由于 <code>/28</code> 掩码更长（匹配更精确），流量将转发至下一跳B。</p>\n<p><strong>默认路由</strong> <code>0.0.0.0/0</code> 匹配所有目标地址，作为&quot;最后的出口&quot;使用，通常配置在企业出口路由器指向ISP网关。</p>\n<p>子网划分计算示例：将 <code>172.16.0.0/16</code> 划分为256个子网，每个子网需要的额外位数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>256</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> 位</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = \\lceil \\log_2(256) \\rceil = 8 \\text{ 位}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">256</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌉</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">位</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>新子网掩码为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">/16 + 8 = /24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">/24</span></span></span></span></span>，每个子网可用主机数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>254</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{8} - 2 = 254</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">254</span></span></span></span></span> 台。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ospf动态路由协议\">OSPF动态路由协议</h3><p>OSPF（Open Shortest Path First）是企业网络最主流的内部网关协议（IGP），基于链路状态算法（Dijkstra SPF）计算最优路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    R1[&quot;Router1&lt;br/&gt;Area 0&quot;] ---|&quot;Cost=1&quot;| R2[&quot;Router2&lt;br/&gt;Area 0&quot;]&#10;    R2 ---|&quot;Cost=10&quot;| R3[&quot;Router3&lt;br/&gt;Area 1&quot;]&#10;    R1 ---|&quot;Cost=5&quot;| R4[&quot;Router4&lt;br/&gt;Area 1&quot;]&#10;    R4 ---|&quot;Cost=1&quot;| R3\">graph LR\n    R1[\"Router1&lt;br/&gt;Area 0\"] ---|\"Cost=1\"| R2[\"Router2&lt;br/&gt;Area 0\"]\n    R2 ---|\"Cost=10\"| R3[\"Router3&lt;br/&gt;Area 1\"]\n    R1 ---|\"Cost=5\"| R4[\"Router4&lt;br/&gt;Area 1\"]\n    R4 ---|\"Cost=1\"| R3</pre><p><strong>OSPF核心概念</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>区域（Area）</strong>：将大型网络分割为多个区域减少LSA泛洪范围，Area 0为骨干区域</li>\n<li><strong>Router ID</strong>：唯一标识OSPF路由器，通常为最大Loopback接口IP</li>\n<li><strong>邻居建立</strong>：Hello包（默认10秒间隔）发现邻居 → 双向邻接 → 数据库同步（DBD/LSR/LSU）→ Full状态</li>\n<li><strong>开销计算</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cost = \\frac{10^8}{Bandwidth(bps)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5379em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>（参考带宽可修改）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于1Gbps链路：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cost = \\frac{10^8}{10^9} = 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3629em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0179em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>，取整为1。</p>\n<p>OSPF使用五种报文类型：Hello、DBD（数据库描述）、LSR（链路状态请求）、LSU（链路状态更新）、LSAck（链路状态确认）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"acl访问控制列表\">ACL访问控制列表</h3><p>ACL实现对网络流量的精细化过滤控制，按照规则序号从上到下逐条匹配，匹配即停止（隐含末尾deny all）。</p>\n<p><strong>ACL分类</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>标准ACL（2000-2999）：仅匹配源IP地址</li>\n<li>高级ACL（3000-3999）：匹配源/目的IP、协议类型、端口号</li>\n<li>二层ACL（4000-4999）：匹配MAC地址、以太网类型</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>通配符掩码</strong>：与子网掩码相反，0表示精确匹配，1表示忽略。例如匹配 <code>192.168.1.0/24</code> 网段使用通配符 <code>0.0.0.255</code>。</p>\n<p>ACL规则设计原则：将匹配频率高的规则放前面以提升转发性能，将更精确的规则放在宽泛规则之前，并在最末尾添加显式的 permit/deny 规则以增强可读性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>EVPN-VXLAN正在取代传统VLAN+STP成为新一代数据中心和大型园区的二层网络方案，通过BGP EVPN控制面实现MAC/IP路由学习，消除了STP的收敛缺陷。Segment Routing（SR）技术在运营商和大型企业网络中快速部署，通过源路由方式简化网络转发，SR-MPLS和SRv6两种实现各有应用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在模拟器中配置包含3个VLAN的交换网络，验证不同VLAN之间无法直接通信，然后通过三层交换机实现VLAN间路由</li>\n<li>构建含有冗余链路的拓扑，观察STP的根桥选举过程和端口角色分配，然后手动修改优先级改变根桥位置</li>\n<li>设计一个包含4个区域的OSPF网络拓扑，配置区域间路由汇总，观察路由表变化</li>\n<li>编写ACL规则：允许研发部（192.168.10.0/24）访问服务器区（10.0.1.0/24）的SSH和HTTP服务，拒绝其他一切流量</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>VLAN通过逻辑隔离实现灵活的广播域控制，STP在冗余拓扑中消除环路保障网络稳定，静态路由和OSPF动态路由分别满足简单网络和复杂网络的选路需求，ACL则在流量转发层面实现安全策略的精细执行。这五项技术相互配合，构成了所有企业级交换路由网络的基础骨架，是网络工程师日常运维和故障排查中使用频率最高的技术栈。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路由交换基础技术","id":"路由交换基础技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"VLAN与Trunk技术","id":"vlan与trunk技术"},{"level":3,"text":"STP生成树协议","id":"stp生成树协议"},{"level":3,"text":"静态路由与默认路由","id":"静态路由与默认路由"},{"level":3,"text":"OSPF动态路由协议","id":"ospf动态路由协议"},{"level":3,"text":"ACL访问控制列表","id":"acl访问控制列表"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OSI与TCP/IP模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols/osi-tcpip-model"},"next":{"title":"无线网络技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols/wireless-network-technology"}}